// Single source of truth: cybermediaboy/CyberLearningLib/6
// @description CyberLearningLib — online learning primitives split from MLLib + kNNLib.
//              Training buffers (circular), feature scaling (EWMA), SGD updates,
//              hinge/log loss, gradient clipping. Stateless distance/kernel
//              functions for downstream kNN consumers.
//              Layer L2. Depends on NumLib + SignalLib.
//
// Step 10a of restructuring. kNNLib is Step 10b (separate file).
//
// CHANGELOG v2:
//   - Added f_sgd_update_gated (gated SGD update from TaUtilityLib)
//   Total exports: 20 → 21
